      "text": "The system's core logic involves `retranscript` (reading transcript lines) and `update_issue`. It uses a two-tiered structure of 'Objects' and more granular 'Issues'. An Issue is a tool for tracking recurring topics; when an Issue is mentioned repeatedly, the importance of its associated Object increases. An Object can be linked to multiple Issues.",
