      "text": "The 'top-down' processing strategy relies on the LLM's ability to handle a large, unsegmented block of text. The model can identify multiple 'objects' or topics within the chunk and process them, so the system doesn't need to worry about perfect pre-segmentation or information loss from truncation.",
