      "text": "The fixed-chunk method is critiqued because it can incorrectly merge multiple ideas. An extreme alternative is processing each sentence for keywords, but this is computationally expensive. A compromise 'dynamic chunking' method is proposed, where the system estimates the topic's span and creates a variable-sized block.",
