      "line_end": 218,
      "text": "SPEAKER_02 proposed a step-by-step execution model to avoid a monolithic process without intermediate visibility. The idea is to have the system perform small tasks (e.g., predict line jumps per turn), write the results to a database for review before proceeding, with the goal of understanding what is happening during the process.",
