      "uncertainty_note": ""
    },
    {
      "line_start": 219,
      "line_end": 222,
      "text": "As evidence for the sufficiency of logs, SPEAKER_00 explained that they record the exact parameters for each function call (e.g., input line range, content being written to memory). This allows developers to reconstruct the database state at any point in time by replaying the logged steps.",
